Package: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect
Name: iPhone 4S Bottom Mic Redirect
Version: 3.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iPhone 4S iOS 6 microphone routing patch. Blocks VideoRecording audio-session mode at both AVAudioSession and legacy AudioSession APIs so iOS 6 selects the primary/bottom microphone instead of the top camera microphone.
Maintainer: RaulKong89
Author: RaulKong89 / ChatGPT
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Conflicts: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect (<< 3.0.0)
Replaces: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect (<< 3.0.0)
